'''Nisetama Army''' (ニセたま軍団) is an enemy that appears in the [[Gudetama Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 6.2 Update|Version 6.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Nisetama Army
|image = E 353.png
|appearance = [[Gudetama Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 900円 - 3,555円
}}

==Enemy==
The supposed real deal of the event, with over 100,000 health, quite good speed and ~5000 damage. It has a strange 332 range and does not have any traits, usually appearing with 100% or 200% strength magnification.

This enemy usually comes in by itself or with some peons, but in the last level there are 3~4 of them with a 200% strength magnification, so beware.

==Strategy==
Though it does have decent range, there are a multitude of cats capable of outranging it; [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hacker Cat]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Wolf]] and a large amount of [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]] come to mind.

